<title>USA: BG&amp;E Md. nuke at 99 pct power Thursday.</title>
<headline>BG&amp;E Md. nuke at 99 pct power Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltimore Gas and Electric Co's 850 megawatt (MW) Calvert Cliffs 2 nuclear unit, which automatically shut down this past weekend, is operating at 99 percent power, the company said early Thursday.</p>
<p>The Lusby, Md., unit tripped off line due to a problem in a feedwater regulating valve.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
